Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.36,0:00:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so good! Yeah! You did that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.64,0:00:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pass it over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.16,0:00:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I got it, I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.62,0:00:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.04,0:00:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, yeah! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.62,0:00:19.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready? Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.98,0:00:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.32,0:00:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give someone else a shot, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.28,0:00:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, look. Unbelievable. In\Nthe middle of the day too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.40,0:00:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's doing it out here too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.12,0:00:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey chimney girl, we're\Nin the middle of a game
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.16,0:01:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raise your hands if you\Nwant to get spanked. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.38,0:01:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your turn, Chimney Girl! Nyah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.06,0:01:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,G-Get the ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.20,0:01:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, that's distracting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.20,0:01:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You okay, Ashtray?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.02,0:01:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't move my limbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.76,0:01:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You only played for two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.70,0:01:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what it's like when you get old.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.12,0:01:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's the nicotine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.28,0:01:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does she need an ambulance?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.80,0:01:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not done yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.36,0:01:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine if I smoke a cigarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.44,0:01:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.58,0:02:01.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we received an anonymous report\Nof a suspicious person chasing children
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.74,0:02:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really have to try\Nto be more careful ma
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.38,0:02:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,'am lucky for you this\Nhappened in Yagami Hara
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.08,0:02:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.78,0:03:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,3401 3401 0101 Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.44,0:04:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.98,0:04:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That stinks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.26,0:04:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.14,0:04:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God, that reeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.64,0:04:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like someone mopped\Nup coffee, cigarette,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.68,0:04:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and sandal soup with a rag\Nand left it in the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.10,0:04:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or like the concentrated stench\Nof human malice and bitterness!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.36,0:04:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.58,0:04:57.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.52,0:05:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The demon Astaroth is\Nupon us, Chainsmoker!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.36,0:05:06.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to evacuate as soon as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.06,0:05:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you even understand how bad this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.96,0:05:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are over 70 carcinogens\Nin cigarettes. 70!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.84,0:05:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to mention that\Nsecondhand smoke is a serious
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.42,0:05:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nuisance to non-smoking\Nneighbors like myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.56,0:05:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I getting through to you, Chainsmoker?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.22,0:05:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your chance of having\Na stroke has doubled.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.66,0:05:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cigarette smoke deteriorates\Nyour blood vessels.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.08,0:05:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is proof that it\Ncauses heart failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.28,0:05:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Naggy, naggy, naggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.54,0:05:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, here's my point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.54,0:05:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A friend of mine is holding a\Nsmoking addiction seminar nearby,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.88,0:05:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I brought you this pamphlet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.10,0:05:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.58,0:05:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, can't see too well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.02,0:05:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd I leave it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.24,0:05:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, this place is gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.48,0:05:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.06,0:05:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.84,0:06:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you got a face on\Nthe back of your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.62,0:06:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're a nicotine\Naddict too, Landlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.42,0:06:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.66,0:06:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.24,0:06:09.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.48,0:06:20.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.39,0:06:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold off on the jokes\Nuntil my face heals a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.66,0:06:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.36,0:06:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you put\Non me, you fucking cat? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.80,0:06:30.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.71,0:06:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.64,0:06:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,feel good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.48,0:06:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or is this just a sense of guilt?\NSure, she's got shit manners, and
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.66,0:06:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's her fault a hundred percent\Nbut maybe i'm being too harsh towards
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.50,0:06:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,her damn it not again using a\Nsense of righteousness as an excuse
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.94,0:06:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}DO NOT PUT NYACOTINE PATCHES\NON THOSE WHO DON'T NEED THEM
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.34,0:06:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To make myself feel good. I'm sorry,\NYaniko. Maybe I was too rude just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.14,0:07:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.68,0:07:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.94,0:07:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.32,0:07:59.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.48,0:08:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.34,0:08:30.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.34,0:08:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many fucking cigarettes\Nare you gonna smoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.56,0:08:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand what a mess you're in?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.96,0:08:35.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.88,0:08:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said if I gave you an extension,\Nyou'd do anything to repay me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.22,0:08:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that anything is weeding the lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.78,0:08:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.82,0:08:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here you are in a cigarette\Nbreak five minutes into the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.98,0:08:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you need a second one already?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.76,0:08:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.70,0:08:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.68,0:08:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And can we stop with the yes, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.88,0:08:52.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.54,0:08:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm confiscating this
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.00,0:09:02.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's stealing Then I will\Nevict you for failing to pay
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.96,0:09:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rent And littering cigarette\Nbutts all over the lot Dumbass,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.98,0:09:08.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll get it back when you're done
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.54,0:09:18.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I can bring her some iced\Ntea or snacks when she's done
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.08,0:09:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you eating something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.98,0:09:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Horsetail Weeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.08,0:09:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got kinda hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.92,0:09:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, did you want some too, Mr. Landlord?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.12,0:09:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.12,0:09:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just don't eat too many or\Nyou'll get a stomachache.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.26,0:09:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yaniko, are you done yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.68,0:09:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I brought some snacks, so, uh, uh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.24,0:09:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, a cigarette?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.58,0:09:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And did she just grow a belly?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.24,0:09:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to my cabbages?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.62,0:10:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow, are those snacks for me? Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.98,0:10:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm pretty stuffed right now,\Nso I'll just save 'em for later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.80,0:10:09.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.06,0:10:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not my eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.18,0:10:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not my eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.90,0:10:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker Cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.82,0:10:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That goddamn chimney.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.94,0:10:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's always up to no good. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.86,0:10:38.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just thinking about her\Ngets me all riled up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.24,0:10:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Riled up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.38,0:10:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Riled. Up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.40,0:10:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damage to wallpaper can become a significant\Nfinancial burden when you move out,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.66,0:10:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.57,0:10:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Particularly when renting,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.02,0:11:04.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one should always be careful about any\Ndiscoloration of the walls from smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.30,0:11:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The walls were painted\Nthis color when I moved in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.70,0:11:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I ventilated the\Nroom from time to time,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.88,0:11:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I'm sure it hasn't\Nchanged from smoking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.52,0:11:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I, uh, should be fine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.12,0:11:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, wasn't that poster...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.16,0:11:21.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was already up when I moved in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.44,0:11:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think my property is haunted?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.38,0:11:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.12,0:11:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're seeing stuff to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.28,0:11:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.46,0:11:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's talismans hidden on my wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.34,0:11:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I heard some loud bangs\Nright after I found them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.70,0:12:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not haunted, then\Nwhat is, Landlord? Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.72,0:12:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way to know\Nwhat happened here! Tha...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.70,0:12:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's even more suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.58,0:12:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Close call
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.98,0:12:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, Yaniko…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.88,0:12:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up, Kansai?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.16,0:12:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you said you told your baby\Nsister that you were swearing off the baka.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.12,0:12:34.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.03,0:12:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your mouth disagrees
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.32,0:12:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm, I'll quit for real this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.50,0:12:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the very last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.16,0:12:42.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.20,0:12:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.11,0:12:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I admire the gumption.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.38,0:12:50.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.60,0:12:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little Yon-Yon acting the funny\Nman is as scarce as Han's teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.32,0:12:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta follow her up right\Nwith a good punchline.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.74,0:12:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coat your horses, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.92,0:12:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't leave to buy milk already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.52,0:13:01.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta try and make it to kindergarten.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.14,0:13:05.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.08,0:13:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't have a daddy growing up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.88,0:13:08.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.02,0:13:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're as cool as a jug\Nof branch water, Yon-Yon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.42,0:13:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't call myself a cat\Nfrom the West if I give up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.84,0:13:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can't get a laugh, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.48,0:13:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you nasty girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.40,0:13:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd this nose hook get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.44,0:13:25.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was stuck in this issue of\Nmanga I borrowed from the landlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.92,0:13:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't believe he put something\Nlike this in a copy of Kirara.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.34,0:13:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you even use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.06,0:13:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You slip this bit on your\Nnose, and you go, boo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.50,0:13:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should try it on,\Nthen! You're nasty! Yuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.96,0:13:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That nose hook is the tool of the devil!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.56,0:13:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, it's not like we're\Nsecond cousins or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.48,0:13:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm really curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.34,0:13:45.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're curious about what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.98,0:13:47.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave me out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.86,0:13:48.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Icky.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.00,0:13:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, you can't ask a young debutante like\Nmyself to do such a thing, you chimney.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.64,0:13:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, now, wait a minute, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.32,0:13:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if this is how I\Ncan get her to crack up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.38,0:14:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, dang it, just get it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.76,0:14:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna make this a habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.34,0:14:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just split your sides already!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.06,0:14:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I get it, you damn chimney.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.42,0:14:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're meowing up the wrong tree, little\Ngirl, but you're gonna learn today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.70,0:14:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those your normal cigarettes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.98,0:14:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I treated myself and\Nbought some pricey ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.40,0:14:34.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you don't get any.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.96,0:14:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't need any. Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.06,0:14:38.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was gonna say about that bird on there,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.74,0:14:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not sure why they call them peace when the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.64,0:14:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bird looks like one of\Nthem migratory ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.80,0:14:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, kind of like geese.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.08,0:14:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One can actually track\Nthe ratio of beast folk to
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.64,0:14:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,humans by how many cigarettes\Nare sold in each region.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.10,0:14:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can also tell if\Ncitizens had to take out
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.18,0:14:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,any credit loans on\Ncars they'll never own.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.74,0:14:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kind of like getting a car on lease.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.34,0:14:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.40,0:15:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I take a break soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.52,0:15:01.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been working all day out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.98,0:15:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got bills to pay, so I've been\Nbusting my ass working as hard as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.76,0:15:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Putting in elbow grease.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.04,0:15:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The suspect is currently fleeing\Ntowards Kariba in a chop shop vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.78,0:15:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mike way a vehicle carrying two\Ngreasy pigs is coming through No,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.88,0:15:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wait, I can't call us pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.22,0:15:17.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're the police
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.26,0:15:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's Beth Palmer's niece!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.24,0:15:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then will an old face with double\NP signs finally make you laugh
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.58,0:15:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Humorous chop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.12,0:15:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I'm sorry, with\Ncherries on top, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.72,0:15:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.54,0:16:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mind if I come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.16,0:16:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.56,0:16:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up, Yaniko?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.20,0:16:13.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't mind, but do you\Nlike me or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.34,0:16:15.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.25,0:16:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you don't ever complain when I\Nsmoke and you let me drink for free,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.98,0:16:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I guess I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.64,0:16:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.12,0:16:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm cool with whatever, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.36,0:16:30.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cool with making me a drink, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.16,0:16:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.28,0:16:32.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's such a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.48,0:16:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brought some smoked cheese bites for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.14,0:16:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I can't really\Nsay no to smoked cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.56,0:16:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.62,0:16:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can dump about half\Na cup of whatever whiskey
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.02,0:16:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got laying around\Nthe house into a mug.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.94,0:16:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Follow it up with all\Nthe syrup as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.00,0:17:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you squirt, squirt, squirt some\Nlemon juice, then add some tap water.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.54,0:17:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.58,0:17:06.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.86,0:17:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got high standards, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.20,0:17:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm not gonna waste\Nany, so I'll finish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.70,0:17:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You care about the environment, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.00,0:17:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the world's getting a little blurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.04,0:17:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh wow, the taste of all this\Nbooze is just a cherry on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.08,0:17:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nothing more than the first\Nstep on the path to euphoria.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.64,0:17:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I need to lay down for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.84,0:17:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should probably call it quits too,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.08,0:17:41.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,while I'm still wrapped up in\Nthe warm veil of boozy happiness.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:42.51,0:17:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}DEMON ICE
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.84,0:17:48.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.44,0:18:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.86,0:18:27.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.78,0:18:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're down for a nightcap, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.62,0:18:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That drinking party was about as\Nmuch fun as a root canal Everyone was
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.86,0:18:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all smiles until I cracked a joke and\Nthey said I was desperate for laughs
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.78,0:18:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry for trying to liven\Nup the party a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.24,0:18:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smiling like a jackass\Neating wires when they
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.18,0:18:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't got the guts to crack\Na joke with their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.12,0:18:54.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No siree, that cat won't hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.18,0:18:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was about to see St.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.12,0:18:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Peter myself, I said. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.92,0:19:06.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You trying to beat me\Nto death's door, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:06.22,0:19:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}RECOVERY POSITION
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.48,0:19:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You little class clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.14,0:19:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jane Spoker Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.16,0:19:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never knew you had such\Na beautiful voice, Kansai.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.80,0:19:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kind of sounds like\Nyou're faking it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.12,0:19:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry for making y 'all\Nhelp me out like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.90,0:19:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like the person who\Nwas supposed to help out
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.38,0:19:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hurt their back at work\Nwhile eating a bento box.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.56,0:19:54.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bento socks?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.60,0:19:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they're made of cotton.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.02,0:19:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, what an idiot. Ha ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.40,0:20:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.80,0:20:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't scoot if we don't\Ngot room to scoot, Yaniko.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.78,0:20:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yakuko, open your window. G-got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.94,0:20:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be funny as all get out\Nif we blasted a toot through the mic?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.24,0:20:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yaniko, point it my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.04,0:20:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get that tail higher!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.40,0:20:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a good girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.60,0:20:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ready to blast out another one?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.44,0:20:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna let it ring loud\Nenough to wake the dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.36,0:20:28.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll get 'em laughing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.98,0:20:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, but that well's just\Nabout run dry, Kansai.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.58,0:20:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll buy you smoke if you pass a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.62,0:20:34.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.62,0:20:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sweet Jesus, you did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.58,0:20:45.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it was a loud one, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.49,0:20:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't they hear us talking, too, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.82,0:20:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep those loud ones coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.46,0:20:50.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're on your way to free cigarettes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.50,0:20:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, baby, that's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.54,0:21:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See a lot of my glasses!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.16,0:21:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.40,0:21:05.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you get shot in the van?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.68,0:21:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What on earth? I got stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.04,0:21:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Totally wouldn't be mad if\Nyou gave me a push, Kansai.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.38,0:21:30.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How in the blue blazes\Ndoes this even happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.92,0:21:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My word is that soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.62,0:21:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't get any good grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.12,0:21:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta flex them blutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.10,0:21:41.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't feel like I'm making\Nany progress at all, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.26,0:21:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it, but don't this sort of thing\Nlook like we're batting for the other team?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.36,0:21:48.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.32,0:21:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just try and bring me some\Nsix from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.66,0:21:52.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't just give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.14,0:21:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna give you a smack if all\Nyou're doing is flexing your butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.38,0:21:58.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.78,0:21:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.90,0:22:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are they scaring at?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.48,0:22:03.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.66,0:22:04.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.57,0:22:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the same hell is wrong with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.38,0:23:58.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.22,0:24:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.

